{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 12460566539572936758,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "TypeTrees for Autodiff",
      "source_hash": 15120370673098790598,
      "context_hash": 7478528553437208974,
      "translation": "오토디프를 위한 TypeTrees",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128754Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What are TypeTrees?",
      "source_hash": 9843270510316972446,
      "context_hash": 286940697151280833,
      "translation": "TypeTrees란 무엇입니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128755Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Memory layout descriptors for Enzyme.",
      "source_hash": 10467335284702996377,
      "context_hash": 9680602752687818583,
      "translation": "Enzyme을 위한 메모리 레이아웃 서술자입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128755Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Tell Enzyme exactly how types are structured in memory so it can compute derivatives efficiently.",
      "source_hash": 1144711685664299030,
      "context_hash": 17523690819972685356,
      "translation": "타입이 메모리에서 어떻게 구조화되어 있는지 Enzyme에게 정확히 알려주어 도함수를 효율적으로 계산할 수 있게 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128755Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Structure",
      "source_hash": 586716415752544071,
      "context_hash": 10686029950595285514,
      "translation": "구조",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128755Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Example: `fn compute(x: &f32, data: &[f32]) -> f32`",
      "source_hash": 15302662281169769473,
      "context_hash": 11173018264108012496,
      "translation": "예시: `fn compute(x: &f32, data: &[f32]) -> f32`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128755Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "**Input 0: `x: &f32`**",
      "source_hash": 10050626963109902575,
      "context_hash": 2572282461007507645,
      "translation": "**입력 0: `x: &f32`**",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128755Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**Input 1: `data: &[f32]`**",
      "source_hash": 5111392560660047913,
      "context_hash": 1641631433204572660,
      "translation": "**입력 1: `data: &[f32]`**",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128756Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "**Output: `f32`**",
      "source_hash": 17436756802284535982,
      "context_hash": 3049662591726134176,
      "translation": "**출력: `f32`**",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128756Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Why Needed?",
      "source_hash": 9732481806569804654,
      "context_hash": 15291364304415011057,
      "translation": "왜 필요합니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128756Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Enzyme can't deduce complex type layouts from LLVM IR",
      "source_hash": 12042911624915988808,
      "context_hash": 4454142838521182842,
      "translation": "Enzyme은 LLVM IR에서 복잡한 타입 레이아웃을 추론할 수 없습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128756Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Prevents slow memory pattern analysis",
      "source_hash": 12592804668317467268,
      "context_hash": 12944656062481505340,
      "translation": "느린 메모리 패턴 분석을 방지합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128756Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Enables correct derivative computation for nested structures",
      "source_hash": 8217735413601856371,
      "context_hash": 1306776001717836461,
      "translation": "중첩된 구조체에 대한 올바른 도함수 계산을 가능하게 합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128757Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Tells Enzyme which bytes are differentiable vs metadata",
      "source_hash": 8101329441664660189,
      "context_hash": 14557014112834876894,
      "translation": "어떤 바이트가 미분 가능한지, 어떤 바이트가 메타데이터인지 Enzyme에게 알려줍니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128757Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What Enzyme Does With This Information:",
      "source_hash": 13513467675481200721,
      "context_hash": 1957356639711188273,
      "translation": "이 정보로 Enzyme이 수행하는 작업:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128757Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Without TypeTrees:",
      "source_hash": 18050109667359506062,
      "context_hash": 16693437617764955064,
      "translation": "TypeTrees 없이:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128757Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "With TypeTrees:",
      "source_hash": 8662196226654146811,
      "context_hash": 8148110511339516378,
      "translation": "TypeTrees 사용 시:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128757Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "TypeTrees - Offset and -1 Explained",
      "source_hash": 13302335636889976451,
      "context_hash": 320679164352587743,
      "translation": "TypeTrees - Offset과 -1 설명",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128757Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Type Structure",
      "source_hash": 10517918061372612641,
      "context_hash": 5136716800829969647,
      "translation": "타입 구조",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128757Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Offset Values",
      "source_hash": 18121914731720427900,
      "context_hash": 18096193054384934569,
      "translation": "Offset 값",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128757Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Regular Offset (0, 4, 8, etc.)",
      "source_hash": 8510691269208030733,
      "context_hash": 15177882083925762688,
      "translation": "일반 Offset (0, 4, 8 등)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128758Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "**Specific byte position within a structure**",
      "source_hash": 7293560337575707545,
      "context_hash": 8152896969657556652,
      "translation": "**구조체 내의 특정 바이트 위치**",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128758Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "TypeTree for `&Point` (internal representation):",
      "source_hash": 12965250711492112096,
      "context_hash": 6343959608403201298,
      "translation": "`&Point`에 대한 TypeTree (내부 표현):",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128758Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Generates LLVM",
      "source_hash": 11774112139169589012,
      "context_hash": 721231024915457663,
      "translation": "LLVM 생성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128758Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Offset -1 (Special: \"Everywhere\")",
      "source_hash": 4056936341763249763,
      "context_hash": 15494290962480542565,
      "translation": "Offset -1 (특수: \"모든 곳\")",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128758Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "**Means \"this pattern repeats for ALL elements\"**",
      "source_hash": 6747279542795406062,
      "context_hash": 15715508188180812021,
      "translation": "**\"이 패턴이 모든 요소에 대해 반복됨\"을 의미합니다**",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128758Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "Example 1: Direct Array `[f32; 100]` (no pointer indirection)",
      "source_hash": 16167083332961177228,
      "context_hash": 17486769175873112703,
      "translation": "예시 1: 직접 배열 `[f32; 100]` (포인터 간접 참조 없음)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128758Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "Generates LLVM: `\"enzyme_type\"=\"{[-1]:Float@float}\"`",
      "source_hash": 8587007636374797172,
      "context_hash": 9443809130002146199,
      "translation": "LLVM 생성: `\"enzyme_type\"=\"{[-1]:Float@float}\"`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128758Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "Example 1b: Array Reference `&[f32; 100]` (with pointer indirection)",
      "source_hash": 17396905211711678654,
      "context_hash": 4383600360525154159,
      "translation": "예시 1b: 배열 참조 `&[f32; 100]` (포인터 간접 참조 있음)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128758Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "Generates LLVM: `\"enzyme_type\"=\"{[-1]:Pointer, [-1,-1]:Float@float}\"`",
      "source_hash": 3857139308594037950,
      "context_hash": 14409924957703894729,
      "translation": "LLVM 생성: `\"enzyme_type\"=\"{[-1]:Pointer, [-1,-1]:Float@float}\"`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128759Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "Instead of listing 100 separate Types with offsets `0,4,8,12...396`",
      "source_hash": 15484016933096941958,
      "context_hash": 5997732516653378815,
      "translation": "`0,4,8,12...396` offset을 가진 100개의 개별 타입을 나열하는 대신",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128759Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:17/seg:0",
      "source": "Example 2: Slice `&[i32]`",
      "source_hash": 10378741150610853644,
      "context_hash": 10575197763872912971,
      "translation": "예시 2: 슬라이스 `&[i32]`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:12:49.128759Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:19/seg:0",
      "source": "Generates LLVM: `\"enzyme_type\"=\"{[-1]:Pointer, [-1,-1]:Integer}\"`",
      "source_hash": 1229851437126505921,
      "context_hash": 15297107390168712660,
      "translation": "LLVM을 생성합니다: `\"enzyme_type\"=\"{[-1]:Pointer, [-1,-1]:Integer}\"`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:00.158817Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:20/seg:0",
      "source": "Example 3: Mixed Structure",
      "source_hash": 17955017734690353756,
      "context_hash": 2237638523766752075,
      "translation": "예제 3: 혼합 구조",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:00.158818Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Key Distinction: Single Values vs Arrays",
      "source_hash": 13511325699970040983,
      "context_hash": 15146795283926044986,
      "translation": "핵심 구분: 단일 값 대 배열",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:00.158819Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "**Single Values** use offset `0` for precision:",
      "source_hash": 3915085025111358604,
      "context_hash": 10405633149273393299,
      "translation": "**단일 값**은 정밀도를 위해 오프셋 `0`을 사용합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:00.158819Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "`&f32` has exactly one f32 value at offset 0",
      "source_hash": 14128304463364702065,
      "context_hash": 5976707626280142899,
      "translation": "`&f32`는 오프셋 0에 정확히 하나의 f32 값을 가집니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:00.158819Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "More precise than using -1 (\"everywhere\")",
      "source_hash": 5354983580731484141,
      "context_hash": 9762840000666822977,
      "translation": "-1(\"모든 곳\")을 사용하는 것보다 더 정밀합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:00.158819Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Generates: `{[-1]:Pointer, [-1,0]:Float@float}`",
      "source_hash": 9233697671953650078,
      "context_hash": 3040615321769655525,
      "translation": "생성 결과: `{[-1]:Pointer, [-1,0]:Float@float}`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:00.158819Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "**Arrays** use offset `-1` for efficiency:",
      "source_hash": 13381487445926832811,
      "context_hash": 18366831336132465605,
      "translation": "**배열**은 효율성을 위해 오프셋 `-1`을 사용합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:00.158820Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "`&[f32; 100]` has the same pattern repeated 100 times",
      "source_hash": 593910987573816824,
      "context_hash": 16142275094170954211,
      "translation": "`&[f32; 100]`은 동일한 패턴이 100번 반복됩니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:00.158820Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Using -1 avoids listing 100 separate offsets",
      "source_hash": 16961516462824893211,
      "context_hash": 12836021828530369901,
      "translation": "-1을 사용하면 100개의 개별 오프셋을 나열하지 않아도 됩니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:00.158820Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Generates: `{[-1]:Pointer, [-1,-1]:Float@float}`",
      "source_hash": 12621810995960125761,
      "context_hash": 6396326918197036857,
      "translation": "생성 결과: `{[-1]:Pointer, [-1,-1]:Float@float}`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:11:00.158820Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}